---
source: tests/help.rs
expression: help(&path)
---
Network policy

Usage: sbt policy [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  init      Choose the network policy for all sandboxes
  allow     Allow network access
  deny      Deny network access
  rm        Remove rules
  ls        List rules
  inspect   Show one rule
  log       Show requests the policy blocked
  check     Test whether a host is allowed
  reset     Remove every rule and the chosen mode
  approval  Blocked hosts waiting for a decision
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -D, --debug
          Print each smolvm command line

  -h, --help
          Print help
